@page id="p5-q" rh="THE 39TH TRIAL · WORKING QUESTIONS" m="YOURS; OPEN QUESTIONS; BACK MATTER LOG"
# Working questions for the Trial
prompt: 1 · Who arranged the withdrawal of the Governor-Prelate's first choice, and when does Eden find out? | 3
prompt: 2 · Who sees Corinne at the river, and what does that person do with it? | 3
prompt: 3 · Why does Nadia withdraw? | 3
prompt: 4 · What is Corinne's trap for Sera? | 3
prompt: 5 · What does Judah do with the recommendation, and what does it cost him? | fill
